ccessible and well documented <a href=3D"https://www.kali.org/docs/developm=
ent/live-build-a-custom-kali-iso/">ISO customization process</a>, it's alwa=
ys easy to generate an optimized version of Kali for your specific needs.</=
p></li><li><a href=3D"https://www.kali.org/docs/"><h4><i class=3D"ti-book">=
